176 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Caring is often a long-term commitment. By taking care of yourself, you ensure that you have the energy and strength to continue providing care without becoming exhausted or overwhelmed.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
