>>
endobj
180 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Caring for a loved one can be emotionally draining. Self-care activities like mindfulness, hobbies, and socialising can help maintain emotional balance, reducing feelings of stress and anxiety.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
