/T (Improving the Quality of Care)
/E (Improving the Quality of Care)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
182 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (When you are well-rested and emotionally balanced, you are better able to provide quality care to your loved one. Your wellbeing directly affects your ability to be patient, compassionate, and attentive.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
