>>
endobj
198 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The '5 Ways to Wellbeing' is a practical and powerful framework that can make a real difference in your life. It encourages you to take five simple yet impactful actions: Connect, Be Active, Take Notice, Keep Learning, and Give. By weaving these actions into your daily routine, you can enhance both your mental and physical health. Taking time to connect with others, staying physically active, being mindful of the present moment, continuing to learn new things, and giving back to others are all steps you can take to create a more balanced and fulfilling life.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
