208 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Connecting with others doesn't have to be time-consuming or complicated; it can be as simple as meeting a friend for a coffee, engaging in a meaningful conversation, or reaching out to someone who might need a listening ear. These small, intentional acts of connection help to strengthen bonds and can significantly improve your mental and emotional health.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
