>>
endobj
214 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Regular Check-Ins: Make it a habit to check in regularly with friends, family, or fellow carers. Even a quick phone call or message can strengthen bonds.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
215 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Join Carer Support Groups: These groups offer a safe space to share experiences, advice, and encouragement with others who understand what you're going through.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
