>>
endobj
228 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Being active is a vital component of your overall wellbeing, as regular physical activity positively impacts both your body and mind. Engaging in activities like walking, cycling, swimming, or even gentle stretching helps to improve your physical health by strengthening your muscles, boosting your cardiovascular system, and enhancing your flexibility. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
229 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Beyond the physical benefits)
/E (Beyond the physical benefits)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
230 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The benefits extend beyond just the physical; being active also releases endorphins, the body's natural mood lifters, which can help reduce stress, anxiety, and depression. Whether you prefer structured exercise routines or simply enjoy being outdoors and moving your body, finding ways to stay active each day can lead to increased energy levels, better sleep, and a more positive outlook on life. By prioritising physical activity, you are not only investing in your long-term health but also creating a foundation for a happier, more balanced life.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
