/K [6]
>>
endobj
257 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In the midst of caring for others, it's easy to lose sight of the small joys that can brighten your day. However, taking the time to notice the world around you and practicing mindfulness can make a significant difference in your wellbeing. Whether it's the warmth of the sun on your face, the beauty of a flower in bloom, or the sound of a loved one's laughter, these simple moments of awareness allow you to reconnect with the present moment. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
258 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Finding calm every day)
/E (Finding calm every day)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
259 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (By being mindful and fully engaged in your surroundings, you can find a sense of calm and clarity, even during the busiest of days. This practice not only helps reduce stress but also enriches your life with a deeper appreciation for the little things that bring joy, making your caring journey more fulfilling and balanced.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
