>>
endobj
281 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (This sense of accomplishment boosts your confidence and can add a fresh sense of purpose to your daily life. By continually seeking out opportunities to learn, you not only enhance your wellbeing but also open up new possibilities for growth and enjoyment, making life richer and more rewarding.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [8]
>>
