/ActualText (Giving to others is a powerful way to create a sense of purpose and build meaningful connections. Whether it's offering a helping hand, sharing a kind word, or simply being there for someone in need, these acts of kindness have a profound impact on both the giver and the receiver. Even small gestures can brighten someone's day and contribute to a positive, more compassionate world.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [3]
