374 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Carer Wellbeing Academy is a dedicated online community designed to promote the wellbeing of family carers and caregivers, supported by robust research. Whether you are caring for a family member, friend, our platform offers a wealth of resources to enhance your personal wellbeing. Carers and organisations alike can benefit from our evidence-based programs, ensuring a supportive environment for social connection and shared experiences. Join us to connect with others facing similar challenges and access valuable tools for your carer journey.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
